1
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:13,000
Welcome to GridGenie, an autonomous renewable-energy microgrid digital twin and dispatch optimizer built for the IEEE ClimateChain Global Hackathon.

2
00:00:12,950 --> 00:00:21,050
Modern microgrids balance rooftop solar, wind turbines, battery energy storage, and dynamic utility tariffs.

3
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:31,687
Without look-ahead intelligence, rule-based systems make costly dispatch mistakes, leaving batteries depleted during expensive peak tariff surges and curtailing clean energy.

4
00:00:31,687 --> 00:00:35,750
GridGenie solves this with physics-constrained optimization.

5
00:00:35,904 --> 00:00:41,391
At the core of GridGenie is an interactive 3D digital twin rendered in real time.

6
00:00:41,341 --> 00:00:48,229
Rather than burying operators in dense tables, the miniature landscape provides immediate physical intuition.

7
00:00:48,229 --> 00:00:52,779
Selecting any asset initiates a cinematic camera transition.

8
00:00:52,779 --> 00:01:06,904
We can inspect the eighty-kilowatt solar array, examine real-time generation from the wind turbines, check the one-hundred kilowatt-hour battery storage system, audit commercial building loads, and monitor interconnection with the utility grid.

9
00:01:07,056 --> 00:01:13,593
The live operations dashboard allows operators to scrub through a full twenty-four-hour operating horizon.

10
00:01:13,543 --> 00:01:25,281
Animated energy flows visualize power dynamics: green streams indicate surplus clean generation charging the battery, while cyan streams show storage discharging to meet evening demand.

11
00:01:25,281 --> 00:01:35,206
At every time step, physical conservation laws are strictly enforced, ensuring generation, storage, and utility imports perfectly match load.

12
00:01:35,376 --> 00:01:41,338
To validate resilience, GridGenie includes realistic operational stress scenarios.

13
00:01:41,288 --> 00:01:49,738
Here, we activate the Cloud Shock Event, simulating a severe storm front that cuts solar output by seventy-five percent at midday.

14
00:01:49,738 --> 00:01:54,201
A naive controller would immediately draw expensive grid power.

15
00:01:54,201 --> 00:02:03,913
GridGenie detects the sudden deficit, reserves battery capacity, and maintains critical commercial loads without violating voltage or ramp-rate limits.

16
00:02:04,080 --> 00:02:11,842
In the Performance Lab, GridGenie benchmarks its look-ahead optimizer directly against industry-standard heuristic dispatch.

17
00:02:11,792 --> 00:02:20,242
The live HiGHS linear programming solver achieves over twelve percent cost savings and a forty-five percent reduction in peak grid demand.

18
00:02:20,242 --> 00:02:28,630
Rule-based heuristics greedily discharge in the morning, leaving storage empty when utility tariffs spike to thirty-eight cents per kilowatt-hour.

19
00:02:28,630 --> 00:02:35,117
GridGenie pre-charges during clean surplus hours and dispatches precisely during peak tariff windows.

20
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:39,192
Autonomous dispatch requires trustworthy predictions.

21
00:02:39,142 --> 00:02:49,517
In the Forecast Lab, scikit-learn Ridge regression models predict twenty-four-hour solar irradiance, wind gusts, commercial building load, and wholesale tariffs.

22
00:02:49,517 --> 00:03:00,755
By auditing model error metrics and comparing them against persistent baselines, operators understand forecast uncertainty before feeding predictions into the downstream optimization solver.

23
00:03:00,912 --> 00:03:05,724
GridGenie gives operators granular control over physical parameters.

24
00:03:05,674 --> 00:03:14,049
Through the configuration drawer, users can adjust battery degradation factors, interconnection limits, and multi-objective weights.

25
00:03:14,049 --> 00:03:25,962
By dialing up the carbon penalty, the optimizer transitions from pure cost minimization to aggressive decarbonization, prioritizing stored renewable energy over fossil-fueled grid imports.

26
00:03:26,112 --> 00:03:33,099
GridGenie bridges the gap between complex energy systems engineering and intuitive operational decision-making.

27
00:03:33,049 --> 00:03:45,349
By uniting interactive 3D digital twin visualization, machine learning forecasting, and mathematical optimization, GridGenie makes clean, resilient microgrids accessible to everyone.

28
00:03:45,349 --> 00:03:47,324
Thank you for watching.

